    Creeping coins also appeared in the old Apple PC game "Wizardry"
which came out about 1980(?) They came in large groups (usually 3
groups of 6,) and were worth lots of experience, but took several
minutes breathing on everyone for no damage (each coin breathed on
all 6 adventurers. It had a one line display that slowly said:
"The creeping coin breathes!"
"Bob takes 0 hitpoints!"
"Al is unaffected!"
   ...)

    It wouldn't be so bad except you could only kill 3 at a time,
so next round 15 breathed on you, then 12... it was sorely tempting
to use up valuable fireballs just to save time.

